<title>USA: Packaging Plus bought SkyNet for $60 mln.</title>
<headline>Packaging Plus bought SkyNet for $60 mln.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Packaging Plus Services Inc, which earlier Wednesday said it acquired Skynet Worldwide Express, of Britain, said the transaction was valued at $60 million.</p>
<p>Lynne Sifford, spokeswoman for Packaging Plus, said the amount is based on the projected earnings of SkyNet for the fiscal year ending June 1998, at 15 times earnings.</p>
</text>
